{
  "comment": "SDE theme palettes: the single source of the colors and shapes of every SDE theme family. tools/build-themes.py uses it for the GTK overlays, libadwaita colors and Openbox themes, and writes generated/theme_palettes.h for sde::Theme (src/common/theme.cpp). Colors are #RRGGBB; shadow_alpha, mica and translucency are 0-1.",
